          "section": "Freight charges",
          "text": "Base freight is charged per kilometre of the booked lane distance, according to the consignment's billed weight: - up to and including 500 kg: \u20b918.00 per km - 501 kg to 2,000 kg: \u20b924.00 per km Consignments above 2,000 kg are quoted case by case and are outside this rate card."
